  "content": [
    {
      "text": "queens of Gentiles shall be Israel’s nursing mothers, 1 Ne. 21:23 (2 Ne. 6:7; 10:9; Isa. 49:23). Lamoni’s queen has faith in Ammon2, Alma 19:2–11. queen overcome by the Spirit, Alma 19:12–18. queen is raised, praises Jesus, raises Lamoni, Alma 19:29–30. Amalickiah reports death of Lamanite king to queen, Alma 47:32–34. Amalickiah takes Lamanite queen to wife, Alma 47:35.",
